WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.800
Unit 2: the files, the checks, the
alert check and the conversion.

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:09.850
The role files are twenty-two, one per
role, with approvers named by alias.

3
00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:13.851
Beside them, a tiers file holds
Microsoft Learn's bounds and the

4
00:00:13.851 --> 00:00:18.313
program's caps for each tier, which
are this workbook's design guidance.

5
00:00:18.313 --> 00:00:23.424
Learn's pages disagree on how long an
activation may last: the role settings

6
00:00:23.424 --> 00:00:28.124
page allows up to twenty-four hours,
the PIM A P I overview at most eight.

7
00:00:28.124 --> 00:00:30.875
The code follows the
stricter, eight hours.

8
00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:34.937
Active assignments are capped at
fifteen days, the owner's decision.

9
00:00:34.937 --> 00:00:36.801
And the plan's order is fixed.

10
00:00:36.801 --> 00:00:40.083
The owner chose Tier 1 as the pilot class,

11
00:00:40.083 --> 00:00:44.162
so wave one is Tier 1, then
Tier 0, Tier 2 and read-only.

12
00:00:44.162 --> 00:00:48.038
The order after the first wave is
this workbook's design guidance.

13
00:00:48.038 --> 00:00:53.280
Rule pim oh seven refuses a wave until
every earlier wave matches its files.
